@startuml
title Plane State Transition Diagram

[*] --> Order

state "Order" as Order
state Arrival
state Preparation
state Operations
state Maintenance
state Withdrawn <<final>>
state OutOfService <<final>>

Order --> Arrival : Delivery / plane delivered
Arrival --> Preparation : Arrival / prepare for operations or maintenance
Preparation --> Operations : Prepared and scheduled for operations / assign to operations
Preparation --> Maintenance : Scheduled for maintenance / send to maintenance

Operations --> Maintenance : No more scheduled flights / send to maintenance
Maintenance --> Preparation : Checked and serviced / transition back to preparation
Maintenance --> Withdrawn : Permanently withdrawn from service / remove from operations
Operations --> Withdrawn : Permanently withdrawn from service / remove from operations
Order --> OutOfService : Plane no longer available for use / take out of service

Withdrawn --> [*] : Removed from system
OutOfService --> [*] : Removed from system

@enduml
